    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transport from Mumbai to Chandigarh | Safe Two-Wheeler Shifting
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How much does bike transport cost from Mumbai to Chandigarh with packers and movers mumbai to chandigarh?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The cost typically ranges between INR 8,000 and 12,000 depending on bike size, model, insurance coverage, and any special handling requirements. Our instant quote tool breaks down each component—distance, vehicle type, packaging, and ancillary services—so you receive a transparent, itemised price without hidden fees.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures are taken to ensure my motorcycle arrives scratch‑free?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We employ a 5‑step zero‑scratch workflow that includes a pre‑load inspection, 7‑layer shock‑absorbent wrapping, custom wooden crates for high‑value parts, hydraulic‑ramp loading onto sealed container trucks, and double‑belt anchorage with IRDAI‑approved marine insurance. Real‑time GPS monitoring adds an extra layer of security.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my two‑wheeler during the 1760‑km journey?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every container truck is equipped with satellite GPS and a live‑tracking portal accessible via our website or mobile app. You receive hourly updates, route snapshots, and instant alerts if any deviation occurs, keeping you informed from Mumbai pickup to Chandigarh doorstep delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance included in the bike shifting service and what does it cover?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">All bike transports come with IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering 100 % declared value against theft, accidental damage, fire, and natural calamities. Optional excess‑free add‑ons are available for high‑value or vintage motorcycles, ensuring complete peace of mind throughout the move.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does the door‑to‑door bike relocation take between Mumbai and Chandigarh?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Standard road transit takes 30‑36 hours, factoring in driver rest periods, mandatory checks, and traffic conditions on NH‑48. Our optimized route and dedicated two‑wheeler carriers often achieve the lower end of this window, with guaranteed delivery slots for residential or corporate addresses.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any restrictions on bike size, model, or modifications for transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We handle all standard motorcycles, scooters, and sports bikes up to 250 kg GVW. Custom modifications, oversized fairings, or detachable accessories must be disclosed; we may require additional padding or a specialized crate. Prohibited items include unregistered vehicles, explosives, or hazardous liquids.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I opt for railway parcel service instead of road transport for my bike?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Railway parcel is available for non‑urgent shipments and can be cost‑effective for bulk moves. However, it involves longer lead times, limited pick‑up/drop‑off points, and additional handling that may increase scratch risk. Our advisory alerts outline these trade‑offs so you can choose the safest, most convenient option.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
